+            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-html-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>To assist property owners in understanding the location of the jurisdictional lines on their property or an area in which they are interested, SCDES BCM developed the <a href="https://gis.des.sc.gov/shoreline/">Beachfront Jurisdictional Lines Viewer</a>. This viewer illustrates the approximate locations of the jurisdictional baseline and setback line. <strong>Please note that to determine the exact position of the baseline and setback line for a specific property, coordinates must be obtained by downloading data from the </strong><a href="https://gis.des.sc.gov/shoreline/"><strong>Beachfront Jurisdictional Lines Viewer</strong></a><strong> and a property-specific survey must be performed.</strong> Coordinates can also be obtained by calling SCDES BCM at <a href="tel:1-843-953-0200">(843) 953-0200.</a></p></div>
